<!--
  Status-bar icon for companion check-ins.

  Android masks notification small icons to a flat white silhouette on API 21+,
  so this is deliberately a solid shape with no colour or gradient — anything
  else renders as a white blob. A leaf, matching the app's Organic identity.

  This file exists because the project has no `mipmap/ic_launcher`: the manifest
  points at the framework's `sym_def_app_icon`, so the usual
  `AndroidInitializationSettings('@mipmap/ic_launcher')` fails to resolve and
  takes `main()` down with it before `runApp`.
-->
